# SRlite / Roadside Radar

Read `AGENT-HANDOFF.md` at repo root for full context.

## GitHub
- Remote: https://github.com/js91tech/SRlite
- Branch: `main`
- Push when user asks; never commit `.env`, `*.db`, or `node_modules/`

## Deploy
- Host: **Railway** (Nixpacks via `railway.toml` + `nixpacks.toml`)
- Volume required: `/app/server/data` (SQLite)
- Env: `NODE_ENV=production`, optional `GA511_API_KEY`
- Health: `/api/health`

## Commands
- Dev: `npm install && npm run dev`
- Build: `npm run build`
- Start: `npm start`

## User goals
- Dispatch lead-fishing tool for Marietta GA (25mi radius, own fleet)
- Finding leads outweighs converting them
